  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-1",
      "quote": "This is a guided path for a curious person, not a course for specialists.",
      "block_id": "december-block-2",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-2",
      "quote": "You do not need calculus, programming, or a GPU.",
      "block_id": "december-block-2",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-3",
      "quote": "Each day opens one idea, points you to the clearest lesson that explains it, and tells you what you will be able to explain afterward.",
      "block_id": "december-block-2",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-4",
      "quote": "The month has six sections.",
      "block_id": "december-block-3",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-5",
      "quote": "The first days are the gentlest; the middle is the technical core; the last days zoom out.",
      "block_id": "december-block-3",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-6",
      "quote": "If a day feels heavy, read the first link and stop there.",
      "block_id": "december-block-3",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-7",
      "quote": "The calendar is a map, not a test -- and you can start today, not only in December.",
      "block_id": "december-block-3",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-8",
      "quote": "31 days main articles optional deep dives sections Made for a general reader",
      "block_id": "december-block-4",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-9",
      "quote": "Colors show which part of the course a lesson comes from",
      "block_id": "december-block-7",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-10",
      "quote": "You have not learned to train a frontier model, and that was never the point.",
      "block_id": "december-block-18",
      "section": "After December",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-11",
      "quote": "You have learned the vocabulary, the shape of the pipeline, and the questions worth asking.",
      "block_id": "december-block-18",
      "section": "After December",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-12",
      "quote": "If you want to keep going, the [course overview](index.php) has the full shelf, and the [Atlas](atlas.php) gives you the same material as a map.",
      "block_id": "december-block-18",
      "section": "After December",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-13",
      "quote": "A few specialist doors sit outside the main path: distributed training, serving stacks, inference kernels, and the deepest excursions into topology and category theory.",
      "block_id": "december-block-19",
      "section": "After December",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-14",
      "quote": "They are all still in the course.",
      "block_id": "december-block-19",
      "section": "After December",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-15",
      "quote": "Use the calendar as a route, not a fence.",
      "block_id": "december-block-21",
      "section": "Further Doors",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-16",
      "quote": "If a side question grabbed you, follow it: [Training Infrastructure](training_infrastructure.php), [Production Serving](production_serving.php), [Inference Optimization](inference_optimization.php), [Topology](topology.php), [The Shape of Holes](geometry_iii.php), and [The Foam of Meaning](foam_of_meaning.php) are all one click away.",
      "block_id": "december-block-21",
      "section": "Further Doors",
      "kind": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "december-stmt-17",
      "quote": "The [Atlas](atlas.php) is the best place to see how the people, places, and ideas in these pages connect.",
      "block_id": "december-block-21",
      "section": "Further Doors",
      "kind": "statement"
    }
  ],
