    {
      "id": "december-block-2",
      "quote": "This is a guided path for a curious person, not a course for specialists. You do not need calculus, programming, or a GPU. Each day opens one idea, points you to the clearest lesson that explains it, and tells you what you will be able to explain afterward.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "section": "Thirty-One Doors into AI"
    },
