    {
      "id": "december-block-18",
      "quote": "You have not learned to train a frontier model, and that was never the point. You have learned the vocabulary, the shape of the pipeline, and the questions worth asking. If you want to keep going, the [course overview](index.php) has the full shelf, and the [Atlas](atlas.php) gives you the same material as a map.",
