    },
    {
      "id": "december-block-21",
      "quote": "Use the calendar as a route, not a fence. If a side question grabbed you, follow it: [Training Infrastructure](training_infrastructure.php), [Production Serving](production_serving.php), [Inference Optimization](inference_optimization.php), [Topology](topology.php), [The Shape of Holes](geometry_iii.php), and [The Foam of Meaning](foam_of_meaning.php) are all one click away. The [Atlas](atlas.php) is the best place to see how the people, places, and ideas in these pages connect.",
